MARCO: I trust my instincts. That's how real businessmen work.

5
00:00:17,275 --> 00:00:21,075
DMITRI: I prefer having data behind my decisions.

6
00:00:21,455 --> 00:00:25,305
DMITRI: Let AI do the thinking. I'll make the decisions.

7
00:00:28,935 --> 00:00:31,260
