8
00:00:31,415 --> 00:00:35,765
DMITRI: Helping me understand the market before I make a decision.

9
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:41,420
MARCO: Wait... two thousand eight hundred and fifty?

10
00:00:41,625 --> 00:00:43,425
GIULIA: How did you manage that?

11
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:47,105
DMITRI: Preparation. Better analysis. And AI.

12
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:52,160
GIULIA: I think I chose the wrong businessman.

13
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:53,415
MARCO: Seriously?!

14
00:00:54,270 --> 00:00:57,295
DMITRI: If you want the same, follow for more.

